OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had no hot water or heating
OL,4,Afor most of my pregnancy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamantha Banner and her partner have
OL,7,Fbeen living without heating or hot
OL,8,Fwater for most of her pregnancy,
OL,9,Frelying on washing in buckets filled
OL,10,Fwith kettle-boiled water, camping
OL,11,Fshowers, or travelling elsewhere.
OL,13,FThe couple are leaseholders of a flat
OL,14,Fat Admiral Court in Croydon, south
OL,15,FLondon, where residents across the
OL,16,Fmixed-tenure development have been
OL,17,Fwithout a gas supply since 4 March due
OL,18,Fto "potentially dangerous leaks".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
