OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had no hot water or heating
OL,4,Afor most of my pregnancy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say they've been caught up in
OL,7,Flayers of bureaucracy among the
OL,8,Ffreeholder, the housing association,
OL,9,Fmanaging agents and the developer over
OL,10,Fwho is responsible for the cost of
OL,11,Fremedial works, making it "hard to get
OL,12,Fanswers."
OL,14,FWith the original developer having gone
OL,15,Finto liquidation, the dispute over who
OL,16,Fshould pay has left residents in the 65
OL,17,Fflats facing uncertainty over whether
OL,18,Fthe cost of replacing the pipework
OL,19,Fcould ultimately fall on them.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
